odule already imports it. It is appended after","+the last line so no existing line moves. A module where every link was","+stripped gets no import, with or without `cascade`. The plugins suite","+bundles two fixtures with the esbuild plugin and checks the metafile:","+the all-stripped fixture has no support module input, and the","+kept-render fixture has one.","+","+Final sizes in kB, brotli, measured with `size-limit` as above:","+","+| Bundle | Size |","+|---|---|","+| core (`index.min.js`) | 3.96 |","+| `microtags/htm` (server) | 1.93 |","+| `microtags/htm` (browser) | 5.29 |","+| example client, stripping on | 8.52 |","+| example client, stripping off | 8.64 |","+| all-stripped fixture | 3.63 |","+| all-stripped fixture, no plugin | 3.65 |","+| kept-render fixture | 3.95 |","+","+The fixtures are `test/fixtures/support-stripped.ts` and","+`support-kept.ts`, bundled with `--minify` against source. The","+all-stripped fixture contains no support code even without the plugin,","+because core never imports it; the plugin only removes the render body.","+The kept-render fixture adds the support module, about 0.3 kB. As","+expected, the example's client still carries the support module through","+the browser templater and Badge and Notice, so stripping saves only","+0.12 kB there (Counter's render body).","+"," [adr-005]: ./ADR-005-single-file-components-with-build-time-render-stripping.md"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/nick/code/microtags.hydration-dx-fixes-14-transform-injects-support-import/README.md","/Users/nick/code/microtags.hydration-dx-fixes-14-transform-injects-support-import/docs/adr/ADR-009-server-render-support-through-render-link.md"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01XwsnKLcrEQdfRnbXXk65ho","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
